{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-2-e7","title":"孙綝怒杀朱异","order":5587,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-2-e7","label":"正文","text":"孙綝怒杀朱异","evidence":["wgc-q0285","wgc-q0029"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houzhu-p0013","role":"以异战不进怒而杀之","evidence":["wgc-q0285","wgc-q0029"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0126","role":"被杀","evidence":["wgc-q0285","wgc-q0029"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0285","wgc-q0029"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0285"}],"persons":[{"id":"houzhu-p0013","name":"孙綝","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0126","name":"朱异","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0029","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"吴将朱异再以大众来迎诞等，渡黎浆水〖1〗；泰等逆与战，每摧其锋。孙綝以异战不进〖2〗，怒而杀之。城中食转少，外救不至，众无所恃。将军蒋班、焦彝，皆诞爪牙计事者也；弃诞，逾城自归大将军〖3〗。﹝一﹞大将军乃使反间，以奇变说全怿等〖4〗；怿等率众数千人，开门来出。城中震惧，不知所为。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140},{"id":"wgc-q0285","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"孙綝以异战不进〖2〗，怒而杀之","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":47}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
